1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,800
This seller wants an AI agent
to refund damaged items on its own.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,200
ReturnLens says not yet: damage refunds
have not passed 5 of 5 test runs.

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:18,200
The agent drafts the refund
and shows why it stopped.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:24,800
Every step of the gate is checked
in code and logged.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,200
Meet ReturnLens, the support agent
that earns its autonomy.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:39,800
Indian sellers spend all day answering
orders, returns, and courier panels.

7
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,500
A customer asks where her order is.

8
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:51,500
The agent calls store and courier tools
and answers from live data.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:04,500
On failed delivery for a COD order,
the agent re-routes to a new address.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,200
Now a harder case: a voice note
and an unboxing video.

11
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:17,800
Order says white headphones.
At 00:05 the video shows black ones.

12
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:25,500
No fraud accusation, no guessing.
It marks the barcode as unverified.

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:35,500
It asks once for a photo of the box label,
and drafts the reply.

14
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:49,500
The seller sees every source and decides.

15
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:59,800
When the buyer returns later,
the agent remembers case and context...

16
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:09,500
...so it never asks twice.

17
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Autonomy is not a setting we hand out.

18
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:24,000
Each case runs 5 times in a harness
checking data, procedure, and messages.

19
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:29,200
8 of 10 scenarios passed all five runs.

20
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:34,800
Under 5 of 5 stays locked.
One click takes it back.

21
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:39,500
Models observe.
Store tools act.

22
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:47,500
Code enforces the money limits.
Every tool call and block is logged.

23
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:59,500
ReturnLens.
Every return decision, backed by evidence.
